      "source_document": "890045",
      "original_line": 195,
      "text": "It was contended that the order for recovery of possession made against the appellant after Allen Berry & Co. had ceased to be a party to the proceedings, was incompetent. This contention was based on an interpretation of the terms of sub-s. (1) of cite16†s. 14 , the material part of which is set out below:",
