    {
      "id": "IK-890045:L261",
      "source_document": "890045",
      "original_line": 261,
      "text": "and parted with possession of the whole of the premises to the appellant. On October 6, 1959, the respondents filed an application before the Rent Controller, Delhi praying for eviction of the tenant and the appellant. The tenant, a limited company, had gone into voluntary liquidation on September 26, 1959 and it was finally wound up and dissolved on October 29, 1960.",
      "provenance": [
        {
          "document_id": "890045",
          "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/890045/",
          "response_index": 0,
          "raw_path": "outputs/legal-rule-support-study-02/sources/raw/890045-window250.txt",
